## ✅ **CRUD Operations – Enhanced Example (MongoDB with JavaScript)**

### 🔹 **Create (Insert)**

```javascript
// Insert a single order
db.Orders.insertOne({
  cust_id: 101,
  amount: 250,
  status: "Pending",
  items: ["Keyboard", "Mouse"],
  order_date: new Date("2025-05-20")
});

// Insert multiple orders
db.Orders.insertMany([
  {
    cust_id: 102,
    amount: 500,
    status: "Delivered",
    items: ["Laptop"],
    order_date: new Date("2025-05-18")
  },
  {
    cust_id: 103,
    amount: 120,
    status: "Pending",
    items: ["Headphones"],
    order_date: new Date("2025-05-19")
  }
]);
```

---

### 🔹 **Read (Query)**

```javascript
// Find all orders
db.Orders.find();

// Find all "Pending" orders
db.Orders.find({ status: "Pending" });

// Find orders with amount greater than 150, sorted by amount descending
db.Orders.find({ amount: { $gt: 150 } }).sort({ amount: -1 });

// Find order by customer ID with only status and amount fields
db.Orders.findOne(
  { cust_id: 102 },
  { projection: { status: 1, amount: 1, _id: 0 } }
);
```

---

### 🔹 **Update**

```javascript
// Update the status of a specific order
db.Orders.updateOne(
  { cust_id: 101 },
  { $set: { status: "Shipped" } }
);

// Update multiple pending orders and add a note
db.Orders.updateMany(
  { status: "Pending" },
  {
    $set: { status: "Processing" },
    $currentDate: { lastUpdated: true }
  }
);

// Upsert example: insert if not exists
db.Orders.updateOne(
  { cust_id: 999 },
  {
    $set: {
      amount: 1000,
      status: "New",
      items: ["Smartphone"]
    }
  },
  { upsert: true }
);
```

---

### 🔹 **Delete**

```javascript
// Delete a specific order by customer ID
db.Orders.deleteOne({ cust_id: 103 });

// Delete all delivered orders
db.Orders.deleteMany({ status: "Delivered" });
```

---

✅ **Bonus – Count and Aggregate**

```javascript
// Count orders by status
db.Orders.countDocuments({ status: "Processing" });

// Aggregate total amount per status
db.Orders.aggregate([
  { $group: { _id: "$status", totalAmount: { $sum: "$amount" } } }
]);
```

